# ogmara-newsbot secrets
#
# Copy to .env and fill in. NEVER commit .env — it is gitignored.
# Recommended: chmod 600 .env

# Bot wallet private key — 64 hex characters (raw Ed25519 key, not a mnemonic
# and not a klv1... address).
#
# USE A WALLET DEDICATED TO THIS BOT. This key IS the identity every post is
# attributed to; anyone holding it can post as your bot. Never use the wallet
# you keep funds in.
OGMARA_WALLET_KEY=

# --- AI provider keys ---
#
# Only the key for your configured `ai.provider` is required. See
# docs/AI-PROVIDERS.md for where to get each one.
#
# Running a local model (ai.provider: openai-compatible) needs no key at all —
# most local servers ignore it. If yours insists, use
# OPENAI_COMPATIBLE_API_KEY below, NOT OPENAI_API_KEY.

# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_API_KEY=

# For ai.provider: openai-compatible. Deliberately SEPARATE from
# OPENAI_API_KEY: that endpoint may be a third party (OpenRouter, a hosted
# gateway), and forwarding your real OpenAI credential to it would leak it.
# Most local servers ignore this entirely.
# OPENAI_COMPATIBLE_API_KEY=
